{"id":"tegami-mqpde6jh","createdAt":"2026-06-22T15:28:21.917Z","version":"0.0.0","changelogs":{"subset-font-family-expansion.md":{"filename":"subset-font-family-expansion.md","packages":{"cargo:takumi":"patch","cargo:takumi-core":"patch","npm:takumi-js":"patch","npm:@takumi-rs/core":"patch","npm:@takumi-rs/wasm":"patch","npm:@takumi-rs/image-response":"patch"},"sections":[{"depth":3,"title":"Expand subset font-family without borrowing the font context","content":"A render holds the font context borrowed while it builds text layout, so per-element\n`font-family` skipped subset-group expansion and routing relied on the fallback bucket, which\nfollowed `fontique`'s hash iteration order. Content registered with `subset_of` (Rust) or\n`subsetOf` (JS) could route to the wrong subset, and the result changed between renders.\nExpansion now reads the subset groups without that borrow, and the fallback bucket follows\nregistration order."}]}},"packages":{"npm:@takumi-rs/core":{"type":"patch","changelogIds":["subset-font-family-expansion.md"],"npm":{"distTag":"beta"},"publish":true},"npm:@takumi-rs/wasm":{"type":"patch","changelogIds":["subset-font-family-expansion.md"],"npm":{"distTag":"beta"},"publish":true},"npm:takumi-js":{"type":"patch","changelogIds":["subset-font-family-expansion.md"],"npm":{"distTag":"beta"},"publish":true},"npm:@takumi-rs/image-response":{"type":"patch","changelogIds":["subset-font-family-expansion.md"],"npm":{"distTag":"beta"},"publish":true},"cargo:takumi-core":{"type":"patch","changelogIds":["subset-font-family-expansion.md"],"publish":true},"cargo:takumi":{"type":"patch","changelogIds":["subset-font-family-expansion.md"],"publish":true}}}